      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat 2026.3.1 (OPEN BETA) August 4, `Build 1881`: https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202623-openbeta#august-4-build-1881\n\n> Increased name cutoff on nameplates by 2 characters.",
